[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "专题9 连续系统的频域分析",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            147,
            86,
            465,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 1：连续系统的频域表示",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            120,
            457,
            139
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、结构框图与网络函数",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            152,
            366,
            168
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知连续LTI系统的冲激响应为 $h(t)$ ，设输入信号为 $e(t)$ ，输出为 $r(t)$ 。若",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            180,
            791,
            197
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$h(t)\\leftrightarrow H(\\omega)$ $e(t)\\leftrightarrow E(\\omega)$ $r(t)\\leftrightarrow R(\\omega)$",
        "bbox": [
            438,
            206,
            557,
            275
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            282,
            171,
            300
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = e (t) * h (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            418,
            311,
            574,
            329
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "根据卷积定理",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            335,
            273,
            351
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR (\\omega) = E (\\omega) H (\\omega)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            413,
            363,
            581,
            381
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            388,
            173,
            405
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (\\omega) = \\frac {R (\\omega)}{E (\\omega)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            436,
            414,
            561,
            451
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$H(\\omega)$ 称为系统函数，也称作系统的频率响应特性。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            460,
            591,
            476
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\text { 时域 } f (t) \\longrightarrow \\boxed {h (t)} \\longrightarrow y (t) \\Rightarrow y (t) = f (t) * h (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            255,
            489,
            726,
            518
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\text {频域} F (\\omega) \\longrightarrow \\boxed {H (\\omega)} \\longrightarrow Y (\\omega) \\Rightarrow Y (\\omega) = F (\\omega) \\cdot H (\\omega)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            253,
            530,
            737,
            561
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 46: 求下列微分方程所描述系统的频率响应 $H(\\omega)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            574,
            618,
            592
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $y''(t) + 3y'(t) + 2y(t) = f'(t);$",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            602,
            445,
            624
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(2) y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 5 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 6 y (t) = f ^ {\\prime} (t) + 4 f (t) 。\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            633,
            517,
            653
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            774,
            954,
            880,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            24,
