    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点3：无失真系统频谱特点",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            111,
            455,
            131
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "所谓无失真是指响应信号与激励信号相比，只是大小与出现的时间不同，而无波形上的变化。设激励信号为 $e(t)$ ，响应信号为 $r(t)$ ，无失真传输的条件是时域表示：",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            143,
            850,
            217
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = k e (t - t _ {0})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            418,
            225,
            574,
            244
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "系统的冲激响应：",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            252,
            302,
            269
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nh (t) = k \\delta (t - t _ {0})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            418,
            279,
            576,
            297
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "系统的频率响应：",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            305,
            302,
            321
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (\\omega) = k e ^ {- j \\omega t _ {0}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            428,
            331,
            568,
            350
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "无失真传输系统的幅度和相位特性如所示。",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            357,
            524,
            375
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/693e9bdba1810fc963ffbce3a95ad82bdbbed535b2be5d2b867ae11614cd0a0b.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            317,
            387,
            677,
            499
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "也就是说， $H(\\omega)$ 的幅频特性必须是一个与频率无关的常数，相位必须是频率的线性函数。",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            514,
            848,
            560
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 47: 在以下由冲激响应或频率响应函数描述的系统中, 能够无失真传输信号的是( )。\nA、 $h(t)=3\\delta(t-3)$ B、 $h(t)=\\sin2t$ C、 $H(j\\omega)=\\frac{2-j\\omega}{2+j\\omega}$ D、 $H(j\\omega)=2e^{-j\\omega}, |\\omega|<1$",
        "bbox": [
            142,
            645,
            848,
            757
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            24,
            344,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
        "bbox": [
            653,
            24,
            880,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "31",
        "bbox": [
            489,
            928,
            507,
            940
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            774,
