    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点4：全通系统频谱特点",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            85,
            431,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "全通系统的幅频特性为常数， $|H(\\omega)| = k$ ，相位特性不受任何约束，一般用来相位均衡器或移相器。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            117,
            850,
            162
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 5：理想低通滤波器",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            147,
            273,
            406,
            293
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、理想低通滤波器的频谱特性:",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            306,
            431,
            323
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "系统函数:",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            332,
            240,
            350
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$H(\\omega) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{ll}e^{-j\\omega t_0} & |\\omega | <   \\omega_c\\\\ 0 & \\omega \\text{为其他值} \\end{array} ,t_0\\right.$ 为常数",
        "bbox": [
            319,
            359,
            670,
            400
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/5629e53470b7069fc5cd18cb8ce0664df446e0ba00140abb14f30c8751f0b5f2.jpg",
        "image_caption": [
            "理想低通滤波器的幅频与相频特性"
        ],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            309,
            406,
            687,
            524
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
