    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点6：相关：比较某信号与另一个延时 $\\tau$ 的信号之间的相似程度",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            85,
            821,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "应用背景：(1)雷达回波识别(2)通信同步信号识别",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            117,
            668,
            137
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、自相关与互相关",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            149,
            324,
            167
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)设 $f_{1}(t)$ 与 $f_{2}(t)$ 为能量有限信号，则",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            177,
            492,
            196
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "互相关",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            205,
            213,
            222
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR _ {1 2} (\\tau) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (t) f _ {2} (t - \\tau) d t = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (t + \\tau) f _ {2} (t) d t\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            258,
            229,
            741,
            269
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "自相关",
        "bbox": [
            149,
            278,
            213,
            294
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR (\\tau) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f (t) f (t - \\tau) d t = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f (t + \\tau) f (t) d t\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            284,
            303,
            717,
            343
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "具有性质",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            351,
            231,
            368
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR _ {1 2} (\\tau) = R _ {2 1} (- \\tau), R (\\tau) = R ^ {*} (- \\tau)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            336,
            381,
            660,
            400
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)设 $f_{1}(t)$ 与 $f_{2}(t)$ 为功率有限信号，则",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            407,
            490,
            426
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "互相关",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            436,
            213,
            451
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR _ {1 2} (\\tau) = \\lim _ {T \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left[ \\frac {1}{T} \\int_ {- \\frac {T}{2}} ^ {\\frac {T}{2}} f _ {1} (t) f _ {2} (t - \\tau) d t \\right]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            327,
            462,
            665,
            517
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "自相关",
        "bbox": [
            149,
            526,
            211,
            543
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR (\\tau) = \\lim _ {T \\to \\infty} \\left[ \\frac {1}{T} \\int_ {- \\frac {T}{2}} ^ {\\frac {T}{2}} f (t) f (t - \\tau) d t \\right]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            344,
            552,
            650,
            609
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、相关与卷积的关系",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            615,
            344,
            633
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR _ {1 2} (t) = f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (- t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            388,
            643,
            606,
            663
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、相关定理",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            670,
            265,
            686
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "维纳—欣钦关系",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            697,
            292,
            714
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} R (\\tau) = \\frac {1}{2 \\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\phi (\\omega) e ^ {j \\omega \\tau} d \\omega \\\\ \\phi (\\omega) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} R (\\tau) e ^ {- j \\omega \\tau} d \\tau \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            368,
            722,
            628,
            801
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "即功率有限信号的功率谱函数与自相关函数是一对傅里叶变换。在实际中，有些信号无法求它的傅里叶变换，但可用求自相关函数的方法，达到求功率谱的目的。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            810,
            850,
            854
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            774,
            954,
            880,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            24,
            344,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
